title Cassette LOAD, Esc during the animation: keys are ignored (the animation is held at 420 ms), Esc finishes it at once and then leaves the app as usual
sizes 480x320 320x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_ANIM_TICKS 42
env CASSETTE_ANIM_FPS 60
env CASSETTE_LOAD_STEP_MS 10
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 500
key l
wait 400
key up
wait 200
key l
wait 1300
key space
key l
key s
wait 300
@480x320 expect text "TAKE 006 · 48k/16 WAV · 12 h 40 left"
expect text "SOFT"
expect noquit
shot load-ignored
say Space, L and S were ignored while the cassette was falling in
key esc
wait 400
expect quit
